    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Stylish, savage, and sexy \u2014 MERCILESS VIXXXEN is rogue-like action redefined.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MERCILESS VIXXXEN</i> is a rogue-like dungeon crawler with a lethal dose of style. Take control of VIXXXEN \u2014 a sexy but deadly, hyper-agile warrior with a beam katana \u2014 and tear through the neon hellscape of <strong>Cyberdam</strong> in a high-octane blend of character action combat and rogue-like replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE THROUGH CYBERDAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/d6220eb2ac1bea2fc1807a0d6e8614b6.avif?t=1746864165\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As VIXXXEN, your mission is simple: <strong>kill the Director</strong>, a shadowy corporate puppet master ruling Cyberdam from the top. Slash, dodge, and combo your way through procedurally-generated zones filled with high-tech enemies, cyber soldiers, and powerful minibosses. Every run reveals more of the twisted truth behind the city \u2014 and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR COMBO SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/3a93d3c1a97e5ba1ceb025ba99c27ea1.poster.avif?t=1746864165\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/3a93d3c1a97e5ba1ceb025ba99c27ea1.webm?t=1746864165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/3a93d3c1a97e5ba1ceb025ba99c27ea1.mp4?t=1746864165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just unlocking moves \u2014 you\u2019re <strong>crafting your own combat system</strong>. Find new attacks, modifiers, and power-ups to build a deadly combo flow that fits your unique playstyle. With thousands of potential builds, no two runs are the same. Upgrade your tech, chain your attacks and become the character action game hero of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BODY PHYSICS &amp; REAL DISMEMBERMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/5424df84501fdec844ebeb574f305fc8.poster.avif?t=1746864165\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/5424df84501fdec844ebeb574f305fc8.webm?t=1746864165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/5424df84501fdec844ebeb574f305fc8.mp4?t=1746864165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VIXXXEN moves like a real action heroine \u2014 with <strong>dynamic body physics</strong> that bring her to life. Her hair, her body, every movement reacts with fluid precision. And when you land a hit, your beam katana <strong>cuts exactly where you swing it</strong>, slicing enemies with <strong>true directional dismemberment</strong> that makes every blow feel brutal and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE YOUR ARCH ENEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/0e2ae8875374b6270ac04dc30ff290bf.avif?t=1746864165\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you die, the enemy that finished you will become an<strong> ARCH ENEMY</strong> \u2014 gaining your abilities and stats. Next time you reach that stage, they\u2019ll be waiting. Take them down to reclaim what\u2019s yours\u2026 or die again and make them even deadlier. Welcome to your own personal boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLOTHES ARE ARMOR \u2014 AND A CHOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/4600fb2b56386cfe1cd4d79cf9e98542.avif?t=1746864165\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your outfit isn\u2019t just for style \u2014 it\u2019s your shield. Every hit shreds your gear, and when you\u2019re fully exposed, you\u2019ll move faster and harvest more blood (your key resource). Rip off your clothes manually for a <strong>high-risk, high-reward mode</strong> that amps up your damage output \u2014 but leaves you one hit away from death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPLAYABILITY IS BUILT-IN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698550/extras/31ed25754772d0d54bb811a9944ac810.avif?t=1746864165\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberdam is always shifting. Hand-crafted cyberpunk environments collide with procedural generated dungeons to create endless replayability. Secrets, new powers, and unexpected enemies lurk in every corner.\u00a0</p>",
